[{"id":177293722,"discussion_id":"03d0727b742cf9cc74818898a2be20f3db0aece9","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| index | ✅ [*黄迪*](https://gitcode.com/kevin_huang1234), [*陈风*](https://gitcode.com/chenfeng61) (2/2) | ✅ [*陈风*](https://gitcode.com/chenfeng61), [*黄迪*](https://gitcode.com/kevin_huang1234) (2/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n SimonZzz, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-06-26T14:21:21+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-30T14:26:50+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177294413,"discussion_id":"d12bfe0e2de11ae48f55ef59749c00c0d3652863","body":"### Notification  \nThis pull request has been changed(code update) or closed, so removes the following label(s): stat/needs-squash.","created_at":"2026-06-26T14:23:59+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-26T14:23:59+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177295653,"discussion_id":"1d0fad28d3b80fc702f5531a15bfc840fb42a482","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复了 `EmbeddingDenseGradV2` 算子在多核（>64 核）场景下的计算正确性问题。由于单个向量寄存器最多容纳 64 个 int32 元素，当核数超过 64 时，原有的 `GatherIndices` 和 `InterleaveIndices` 实现无法一次性处理全部索引，导致末尾核的边界索引丢失。此变更引入循环分块处理机制，将索引的 gather/interleave 操作按寄存器容量分批次执行，同时新增 `CopyScaleFreqFromWs`、`GatherScaleFreq`、`CalcFreqBetweenBlock` 三个函数以支持多核间频率的收集与聚合，并修正了多核同步时的参与核范围判定逻辑。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **`GatherIndices` 增加分块循环**：按 `perVfProcessNum`（单个向量寄存器可容纳的元素数，int32 下为 64）将 begin 端和 end 端索引分批次进行 gather 操作，避免核数 > 64 时因寄存器容量不足导致末尾核边界索引无法取回。\n- **`InterleaveIndices` 增加分块循环**：按 `perInterleave`（两倍寄存器容量，int32 下为 128）将索引交错操作拆分为多个循环批次，解决核数 > 64 时 `totalIndicesNum` 超过单次 Interleave 处理上限的问题。\n- **新增三个核间频率处理函数**：`CopyScaleFreqFromWs` 从 workspace 拷贝多核的频率数据到 UB；`GatherScaleFreq` 通过 gather 方式重排频率数据；`CalcFreqBetweenBlock` 对每个去重索引在核间汇总频率求和。这些函数在 `ProcessGradBetweenBlock` 的 `isScale` 分支中被调用，以支持多核场景下带缩放的梯度累加。\n- **修正 `Process` 中多核同步逻辑**：SplitEltwiseAxis 路径中，`ProcessGradBetweenBlock` 的触发条件从原先的 `blockIdx_ == 0` 改为 `blockIdx_ < tiling_.blockNumForLastProcess`，使多个 block 参与核间处理；同时在外层循环每次迭代前重置 `isBeginRecord_`、`isBeginPadding_`、`firstResIdx_`、`firstResCount_`、`lastResIdx_`、`lastResCount_` 状态变量并调用 `PipeBarrier` 同步。\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-26T14:28:51+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-26T14:28:51+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177299712,"discussion_id":"249ae3652f1f6e4456fa8c98083dc1847bb77186","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n经过对 `index/embedding_dense_grad_v2/op_kernel/v35/embedding_dense_grad_v2_regbase.h` 中所有改动的仔细审查，包括：\n\n1. **`GatherIndices` 函数**（行 1060-1126）：将单次 gather+copy 改为分块循环处理，每块处理 `perVfProcessNum`（=64）个元素。对于 int64 类型，`RegTraitNumTwo` 使得单个 `RegTensorType` 跨越两个向量寄存器，恰好容纳 64 个 int64 元素，与循环块大小对齐。`pMaskAll` 覆盖全部 64 个位置，尾部使用 `pTail` 掩码限制有效元素数，逻辑正确。源指针按 `srcStride = perVfProcessNum * interval` 步进、目的指针按 `perVfProcessNum` 步进，就地 gather 不会产生读写冲突。\n\n2. **`InterleaveIndices` 函数**（行 1141-1190）：将单次 Interleave 改为分块循环，每块处理 `perInterleave = 128` 个输出元素。每次循环从 begin/end 各读取 64 个元素，交错产生 128 个元素并写出。剩余元素通过掩码 `DataCopy` 从 `vDstReg0` 写出，AscendC 的掩码写操作会自动跨寄存器读取（`vDstReg0` 后紧邻 `vDstReg1`），能正确处理 `remainNum` 不超过 127 的所有情况。循环计数、边界条件和指针推进均正确。\n\n3. **掩码变更**：从 `UpdateMask`（按元素计数）改为 `CreateMask<ALL>`（全覆盖），在新的分块循环语义下是正确的——循环处理完整寄存器块，尾部用 `UpdateMask` 限制。\n\n4. **类型与常量**：`perVfProcessNum = platform::GetVRegSize() / sizeof(int32_t)` 是编译期常量，对 int32 和 int64（配合 `RegTraitNumTwo`）均得到 64；`DOUBLE = 2`；指针类型转换与旧代码一致。\n\n**结论：未发现该 diff 引入的正确性、安全性、可靠性或破坏性变更问题。**\n\n---\n\n## 审查摘要\n\n- **审查文件数**: 1\n- **发现问题数**: 0\n  - P0: 0\n  - P1: 0\n  - P2: 0\n  - P3: 0\n- **整体风险判断**: 低风险。变更是对多核场景（核数 > 64）的正确扩展，将原来的单次向量寄存器操作改为分块循环处理，逻辑自洽且与原有 ≤64 核场景行为兼容。\n\n| 类型 | 数量 |\n|------|-------|\n| \uD83D\uDD34 阻塞 | 1 |\n| \uD83D\uDFE1 建议 | 0 |\n\n⛔ 需要修改\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-26T14:44:40+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-26T14:44:40+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177299717,"discussion_id":"d8bea0538c7473f24e0f031b2457e58eda4dd3fb","body":"\uD83D\uDFE0 **High Priority**\n\n**变更行**：第 1178–1189 行（`if (remainNum > 0)` 块内）。\n\n**问题**：循环体中对 `vDstReg0` 和 `vDstReg1` 均执行 `DataCopy` 写出，但尾部处理只写出了 `vDstReg0`。当 `remainNum > perVfProcessNum`（即 >64）时，有效数据同时落在 `vDstReg0` 和 `vDstReg1` 中，只写出前者会丢失 `remainNum - perVfProcessNum` 个元素。\n\n**触发条件**：`totalIndicesNum = tiling_.usedCoreNum * 2 - 1`，`remainNum = totalIndicesNum % (perVfProcessNum * 2)`。当 `remainNum > perVfProcessNum` 时触发。以 `perVfProcessNum = 64` 计，`usedCoreNum = 97` 时 `remainNum = 65 > 64`，即核数 ≥97 时必触发（且核数不是 64 的整数倍时也有一部分情况触发）。\n\n**后果**：`InterleaveIndices` 产出的重排索引数组尾部元素为零/未定义值，下游 `CalcDupNum` 等依赖该数组的逻辑结果错误，最终导致梯度聚合结果不正确。\n\n**注释**（行 1182）写明\"核数<=72时 remainNum <= 15 < 64\"，但本 PR 目标正是修复多核场景，该假设与目标矛盾。\n\n**建议**：在尾部处理中增加对 vDstReg1 的分段写出：当 remainNum > perVfProcessNum 时，先从 vDstReg0 写出 perVfProcessNum 个元素，再从 vDstReg1 写出剩余 (remainNum - perVfProcessNum) 个元素。可参考旧代码中 lowerMask/higherMask 两段写出的模式。","created_at":"2026-06-26T14:44:41+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-29T16:56:55+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"68ee04e1614d904578783c60","login":"SimonZzz","object_id":"68ee04e1614d904578783c60","name":"SimonZzz","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/SimonZzz"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":1171,"end_new_line":1171,"start_old_line":1136,"end_old_line":1136,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":177666685,"discussion_id":"00ac71077bd8b930e8defed66f24b4f0f932ea73","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-06-29T17:08:43+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-29T17:08:43+08:00","user":{"id":"68ee04e1614d904578783c60","login":"SimonZzz","object_id":"68ee04e1614d904578783c60","name":"SimonZzz","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/SimonZzz"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177667532,"discussion_id":"8d40d8c6abcc2493f1bc8f46dd182621ffcc4caa","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a